-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 10 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 10 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 10 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Inference-এর language শিখুন: population হলো full group of interest, sample observed হয়, parameter population describe করে এবং statistic sample describe করে।\" data-en=\"Learn the language of inference: the population is the full group of interest, a sample is observed, a parameter describes the population, and a statistic describes the sample.\">Learn the language of inference: the population is the full group of interest, a sample is observed, a parameter describes the population, and a statistic describes the sample.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 45 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Population ও sample define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define population and sample.\">Define population and sample.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Parameter ও statistic আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish parameter and statistic.\">Distinguish parameter and statistic.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Target population clearly define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define a target population clearly.\">Define a target population clearly.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Sampling uncertainty explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain sampling uncertainty.\">Explain sampling uncertainty.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Population ও sample\" data-en=\"Population and sample\">Population and sample</h2><p data-bn=\"Population হলো complete set of people, event, transaction বা measurement যার সম্পর্কে question করা হয়। Sample হলো actually observed subset। Target population-এ location, eligibility ও time boundary থাকতে হবে।\" data-en=\"The population is the complete set of people, events, transactions, or measurements about which a question is asked. A sample is the subset actually observed for analysis. The target population must include boundaries such as location, eligibility, and time.\">The population is the complete set of people, events, transactions, or measurements about which a question is asked. A sample is the subset actually observed for analysis. The target population must include boundaries such as location, eligibility, and time.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Parameter ও statistic\" data-en=\"Parameter and statistic\">Parameter and statistic</h2><p data-bn=\"Parameter population-এর numerical characteristic, যেমন সব eligible household-এর true mean income। এটি সাধারণত unknown। Statistic sample data থেকে calculate হয়, যেমন sample mean, এবং parameter estimate করতে ব্যবহৃত হয়।\" data-en=\"A parameter is a numerical characteristic of a population, such as the true mean income of all eligible households. It is often unknown. A statistic is calculated from sample data, such as the sample mean, and is used to estimate the parameter.\">A parameter is a numerical characteristic of a population, such as the true mean income of all eligible households. It is often unknown. A statistic is calculated from sample data, such as the sample mean, and is used to estimate the parameter.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Sampling uncertainty\" data-en=\"Sampling uncertainty\">Sampling uncertainty</h2><p data-bn=\"একই population থেকে different valid sample সাধারণত different statistic দেয়। এই natural variation sampling uncertainty। এটি automatically mistake নয়; inference probability ও standard error দিয়ে quantify করে।\" data-en=\"Different valid samples from the same population generally produce different statistics. That natural variation is sampling uncertainty. It is not automatically a mistake; inference uses probability and standard errors to quantify it.\">Different valid samples from the same population generally produce different statistics. That natural variation is sampling uncertainty. It is not automatically a mistake; inference uses probability and standard errors to quantify it.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Census সবসময় perfect নয়\" data-en=\"Census is not always perfect\">Census is not always perfect</h2><p data-bn=\"Census সব population member observe করতে চায়, কিন্তু missing record, measurement error, duplication, timing mismatch ও processing error থাকতে পারে। Carefully designed sample কোনো specific question-এ বেশি feasible ও reliable হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"A census attempts to observe every population member, but can still have missing records, measurement error, duplication, timing mismatch, and processing error. A carefully designed sample may sometimes be more feasible and reliable for a specific question.\">A census attempts to observe every population member, but can still have missing records, measurement error, duplication, timing mismatch, and processing error. A carefully designed sample may sometimes be more feasible and reliable for a specific question.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Population\" data-en=\"Population\">Population</h3><p data-bn=\"যে entire defined group সম্পর্কে conclusion intended।\" data-en=\"The entire defined group about which conclusions are intended.\">The entire defined group about which conclusions are intended.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Sample\" data-en=\"Sample\">Sample</h3><p data-bn=\"Population-এর observed subset।\" data-en=\"The observed subset of the population.\">The observed subset of the population.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Parameter\" data-en=\"Parameter\">Parameter</h3><p data-bn=\"Population-এর numerical characteristic।\" data-en=\"A numerical characteristic of a population.\">A numerical characteristic of a population.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Statistic\" data-en=\"Statistic\">Statistic</h3><p data-bn=\"Sample থেকে calculated numerical summary।\" data-en=\"A numerical summary calculated from a sample.\">A numerical summary calculated from a sample.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Employee satisfaction survey\" data-en=\"Employee satisfaction survey\">Employee satisfaction survey</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একটি organization-এ 500 eligible employee এবং 120 selected employee survey করা হয়েছে।\" data-en=\"An organization has 500 eligible employees and surveys 120 selected employees.\">An organization has 500 eligible employees and surveys 120 selected employees.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"500 eligible employee target population।\" data-en=\"The 500 eligible employees are the target population.\">The 500 eligible employees are the target population.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"সব selected respond করলে 120 respondent observed sample।\" data-en=\"The 120 respondents form the observed sample if all selected responded.\">The 120 respondents form the observed sample if all selected responded.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"সব 500-এর true average satisfaction parameter।\" data-en=\"The true average satisfaction of all 500 is a parameter.\">The true average satisfaction of all 500 is a parameter.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"120-এর average statistic।\" data-en=\"The average among the 120 is a statistic.\">The average among the 120 is a statistic.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Nonresponse বা poor selection ordinary sampling variation-এর বাইরে bias তৈরি করতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Nonresponse or poor selection can make the statistic biased, beyond ordinary sampling variation.\">Nonresponse or poor selection can make the statistic biased, beyond ordinary sampling variation.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Defensible sampling ও measurement process থাকলেই statistic parameter estimate করে।\" data-en=\"A statistic estimates a parameter only under a defensible sampling and measurement process.\">A statistic estimates a parameter only under a defensible sampling and measurement process.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Population full defined group।\" data-en=\"The population is the full defined group.\">The population is the full defined group.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Sample observed subset।\" data-en=\"The sample is the observed subset.\">The sample is the observed subset.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Parameter population describe করে।\" data-en=\"Parameters describe populations.\">Parameters describe populations.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Statistic sample describe করে এবং sample অনুযায়ী vary করে।\" data-en=\"Statistics describe samples and vary across samples.\">Statistics describe samples and vary across samples.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-1-definitions-of-statistics-probability-and-key-terms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Definitions of Statistics, Probability, and Key Terms ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-2-data-sampling-and-variation-in-data-and-sampling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Data, Sampling, and Variation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.census.gov/topics/research/stat-research/expertise/survey-sampling.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">U.S. Census Bureau — Survey Sampling ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}